This is a modified work based on shyim/lite4mariadb, itself a fork of MariaDB
Server. MariaDB's WebAssembly port is upstream work, not an original port by
mariamem. The upstream C wrapper and CMake files are modified by the patches
and overlays in this repository. Changes made in September 2026 include a
resident session protocol, native result metadata, reusable session workers,
cold filesystem export/restore, a Go MySQL protocol host, and testing APIs.

MariaDB Server includes work by Oracle and/or its affiliates, MariaDB and many
other contributors. Original notices are preserved in the corresponding source.
